# T-Mobile web/application domain rules for Surge
# Scope: T-Mobile US websites, customer/account surfaces, T-Life-related web endpoints,
#       T-Mobile MONEY, Metro by T-Mobile, legacy T-Mobile domains, and first-party CDN.
# Excludes: cellular carrier IP ranges, IMS/ePDG, Wi-Fi Calling, and generic third-party CDNs.

# Core T-Mobile US / account / prepaid / business / community / fiber
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t-mobile.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tmobile.com

# T-Mobile short links
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t-mo.co

# First-party/brand CDN hosted on Adobe Scene7
DOMAIN,t-mobile.scene7.com

# T-Mobile MONEY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t-mobilemoney.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tmobilemoney.com

# Metro by T-Mobile
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metrobyt-mobile.com

# T-Mobile Tuesdays legacy web domain
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t-mobiletuesdays.com

# Employee benefits site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t-mobilebenefits.com

# Legacy / compatibility domains
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t-mobile.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tmobile.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t-mobile.us
